{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Sapele FearPark</strong>, an immersive horror game set in a <strong>long-forgotten amusement park</strong>, now overrun by <strong>nightmarish creatures</strong>, <strong>twisted animals</strong>, and <strong>demonic forces</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in a quiet house. As you turn on the television, a disturbing news report catches your attention: <strong>12 police officers have mysteriously vanished</strong> inside an abandoned amusement park that\u2019s been closed to the public for years. Soon, you realize that other curious people have entered the park\u2026 but none have ever returned. Complete radio silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity\u2014or madness\u2014you decide to enter the cursed place yourself. But what you\u2019ll discover inside <strong>defies all logic... and sanity</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a terrifying abandoned amusement park</strong>, filled with eerie attractions, decaying rides, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face terrifying entities</strong>: mutated animals, reanimated corpses, demonic presences\u2026 danger lurks around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and riddles</strong> to progress and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling atmospheric sound design</strong>, with immersive audio, ambient music, and haunting voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A progressive narrative</strong>, where each clue leads you deeper into the mystery\u2014and closer to the ultimate horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong>: survive, uncover the truth, and stop the park from luring more victims into its deadly trap.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun