res:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a terrifying abandoned amusement park</strong>, filled with eerie attractions, decaying rides, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face terrifying entities</strong>: mutated animals, reanimated corpses, demonic presences\u2026 danger lurks around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and riddles</strong> to progress and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling atmospheric sound design</strong>, with immersive audio, ambient music, and haunting voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A progressive narrative</strong>, where each clue leads you deeper into the mystery\u2014and closer to the ultimate horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong>: survive, uncover the truth, and stop the park from luring more victims into its deadly trap.</p>","developers":["tristan","cyril","chopin"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434220/0ac1e0253835b9f1d25e65c6f2f741b232ed756c/header.jpg?t=1771152490","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434220/239482337/64c9ad8911f492de052308709b5d910108132d35/1765727038/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765728065","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434220/239482337/64c9ad8911f492de052308709b5d910108132d35/1765727038/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765728065","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3434220/239482337/64c9ad8911f492de052308709b5d910108132d35/1765727038/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765728065","id":257249571,"name":"FearPark Trailer GamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257249571/2df6526f82afffef15b6a073c4d10563cdd3415d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765728065"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto